00:57:59.830 --> 00:58:03.740
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia. I'm Ira Glass.

00:58:03.740 --> 00:58:09.920
<v Sandra Tsing Loh>Papa, I'm going to tell this story now the way I tell it. So I hope you're not embarrassed, OK?

00:58:09.920 --> 00:58:13.340
<v Eugene Loh>OK. What choice do I have?

00:58:13.340 --> 00:58:57.170
<v Ira Glass>Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

00:58:57.170 --> 00:59:02.170
